================================================================================================
  the 23 is the reference's DEEPEST degree, not its Main - it was
  recorded in research/lit.py as 'deep-degree IDM count 21 vs
  reference 23'. So Deep is the row that has to match, and Main
  being far below it is expected rather than a fault.
  depth      taken   per 2000 bars   vs ref 23   BOS-first    n
  main          19             3.3       0.14x       70.6%   17
