  deep         170            29.5       1.28x       62.9%   35
  reference first passage 56.5% BOS-first.

================================================================================================
INVARIANTS - any non-zero row is a real defect
================================================================================================
  all clean across every depth and every symbol

================================================================================================
ARE THE THREE DEPTHS DIFFERENT STRUCTURES
================================================================================================
  ONE normalized stream - repeated normalization is idempotent and
  was measured to filter nothing. Each depth owns its own ORIENTED
  detector and its own scope, which is what makes the pivots differ.
  depth      pivots    IDM  taken   BOS  flip  resets  latent used
  main         1574    567    278   198    95       0          122
  int          3052   1513    703   322   114     571          179
  deep         4383   2567   1210   398   100    1139          187

