================================================================================================
ARE THE DEPTHS MIRRORING EACH OTHER
================================================================================================
  the brief's complaint is iBOS/iCHoCH that duplicate Main. a level
  published by a child at the SAME price and SAME anchor bar as one
  its parent published is a mirror, not internal structure.
  pair                child levels   identical to parent   share
  main -> int                 2538                   442   17.4%
  int -> deep                 4175                  1218   29.2%
  anything approaching 100% means the hierarchy is decorative.
